---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact • takien.com"
  description="Informasi kontak dan media sosial takien"
>
  <div class="content-container">
    <div style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        Contact
      </h1>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1rem;">
        Hubungi atau temukan takien di media sosial.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Karena blog ini telah diarsipkan secara statis di GitHub Pages, form kontak lama dinonaktifkan.
      </p>

      <h2>Profil & Jejaring Sosial</h2>
      <p>Anda dapat terhubung atau melihat repositori proyek saya melalui:</p>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>GitHub</strong>: <a href="https://github.com/takien" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/takien</a></li>
        <li><strong>Twitter / X</strong>: <a href="https://twitter.com/cektkp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@cektkp</a></li>
        <li><strong>Facebook</strong>: <a href="https://facebook.com/takien" target="_blank" rel="noopener">facebook.com/takien</a></li>
        <li><strong>YouTube</strong>: <a href="https://youtube.com/cektkp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">youtube.com/cektkp</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
